  "job_B12.5.11.7_20260920_210259": {
    "text": "Aefter \u00feam \u00fee se mettruma his \u00feing becwedene h\u00e6f\u00f0, underfo se m\u00e6ssepreost his andetnesse and\nAnd understande se sacerd hw\u00e6t se h\u00e6lend \u00feurh \u00feone witegan cw\u00e6\u00f0, Gif \u00feu \u00feam unrihtwisan nylt his\nAnd wite se sacerd \u00feeahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere, andette se untruma, \u00fe\u00e6t he andette mid Godes fultume \u00feurh\n\u00de\u00e6t he hine ne ofersyme ne on orwennesse ne bringe, ac him \u00feus tocwe\u00f0e, swa swa se h\u00e6lend \u00feurh\nAnd eft he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00feonne se synfulla his synna begeomra\u00f0, \u00feonne wur\u00f0 he gehealden.\nAnd \u00fey d\u00e6ge \u00fee se synfulla gecyr\u00f0 fram his synnum to d\u00e6dbote, \u00fey d\u00e6ge he leofa\u00f0 and nane swelte\u00f0.\nGyt he cwy\u00f0, Andette \u00fee sylf \u00feine unrihtwisnessa, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu m\u00e6ge beon gerihtwisod, for \u00feam \u00fee se sealm\n\u00d0onne \u00e6fter \u00feisse timbrunge \u00feises drihtenlican behates, sy\u00f0\u00f0an se untruma namm\u00e6lum his synna and\nNu andette ic minum drihtne and eallum his halgum and \u00fee, \u00fee min gastlice scrifte eart, \u00fe\u00e6t ic\nGeswicenesse ic behate and \u00e6fter \u00feinre t\u00e6cinge d\u00e6dbetan wille mid eadmodlicre onhnigenesse, gif min\nAnd ic bidde \u00fee, \u00fee min gastlica lareow eart, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu me fore\u00feingie and beforan mines drihtnes\n\u00d0onne bletsige se preost axan and \u00fea sceolon beon, gif man h\u00e6f\u00f0, of wingearde geworhte.",
